            "text": "Abstract class for a suite of crypto algorithms used by the SDK to perform digital signing, encryption/decryption and secure hashing. A complete suite includes support for asymmetric keys (such as ECDSA or RSA), symmetric keys (such as AES) and secure hash (such as SHA2/3)."
